! dataset !! before (f) !! (f), per-locator <code>sbm_add_grow</code> !! (f) !! btree(a) pages
|-
| ''one'' || 0.18-0.19 s / 2737 || 0.86-0.94 s / 25 || 0.19-0.21 s / 25 || 849
|-
| kc || 1.57-1.68 s / 27346 || 7.59-8.17 s / 253 || 1.66-1.89 s / 253 || 8489
|-
| ks || 2.74-2.90 s / 27346 || 5.01-5.75 s / 7629 || 2.93-3.44 s / 7629 || 8489
